∇² x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 6
  ∂²/∂x² x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 2
  ∂²/∂y² x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 2
  ∂²/∂z² x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 2
  holds wherever the formulas are defined
  check: every entry matches central differences at 600 points (max relative difference 4e-13)
